    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting way to frame it. When you say \"the reality is that art today is measured by its capacity to challenge power structures,\" are you saying that the traditional idea of \"artistic merit\" or formal beauty is basically becoming obsolete in the professional art world?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
